# SPRINT 21 — CLIENT AI TEAM v1

## Mission

Implement the first complete business-specific AI team for Freelancify:

# CLIENT AI TEAM

This sprint transforms the generic agent platform into a real client-facing AI team while preserving the existing architecture.

The system must support:

User / Client
→ AG-001 Master Orchestrator
→ Intent Detection
→ Context Builder
→ Platform Routing
→ Sprint 20 Coordination
→ Client AI Team
→ AG-002 Memory
→ AG-003 Knowledge
→ AG-004 Tools
→ LLM / Agentic Reasoning
→ Result Aggregation
→ AG-001
→ Final Client Response

This is a production-oriented implementation.

Do NOT implement Freelancer AI Team, Marketplace AI Team, Marketing AI Team, or Admin AI Team in this sprint.

