# 7. CLIENT AGENT CAPABILITY MODEL

Every Client AI agent must declare capabilities using Sprint 19 rules.

Capabilities should be narrowly scoped.

Examples:

* `client.project.create`
* `client.project.clarify`
* `client.project.scope`
* `client.freelancer.discover`
* `client.proposal.evaluate`
* `client.communication.assist`

Only use capabilities actually supported by the agent.

Do not grant broad wildcard permissions.

