# 23. CANCELLATION / TIMEOUT

Client workflows must propagate:

* AbortSignal
* global deadline
* per-task timeout

If the user/request is cancelled:

* stop pending work
* cancel running work
* release execution leases
* stop tool calls where possible
* return deterministic cancellation state

No leaked resources.

